# IMX round 4: the new play modes. Instrument 1 is a 1 s sine in 1-Shot Rev, track 1 plays it on step 1 of every pass (3.7 s). The setup pokes switch the instrument between the passes to Pingpong Rev, Oscillator and a 1-Shot with Repitch Steps 4. The trace follows the voice (pm = the play mode, play = the voice sounds): each mode starts the voice, the Oscillator voice keeps sounding past the 1 s of the sample (it loops), the Repitch voice lasts less than the plain one. Sample audio is silent in the sim (wav peak 0), so the proof is the voice state of the audio engine
# Replay: plus_flows.sh plus  (setup pokes in plus_flows.sh, the poke trace UISHOT_TRACE_FFSTATE is the read, poke_ok in plus_flows.sh)
title: sample play modes 1-Shot Rev, Pingpong Rev, Oscillator, Repitch (Tracker+, IMX round 4)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

use boot-to-pattern
wait 3000ms
tap Play
wait 27000ms
shot playmodes-playing
tap Play
wait 1500ms
shot playmodes-stopped
